      en: ["The field was discovered in 1951 as Saudi Arabia's first offshore oil field.", "Maximum production capacity stands at 1.2 million barrels per day.", "It covers an area of approximately 50 by 15 kilometers in the Persian Gulf.", "The oil reservoir is located at depths between 1,500 and 2,100 meters.", "Commercial export of oil officially commenced in April 1957.", "It contains estimated proven oil reserves of over 37 billion barrels."],
      es: ["Descubrimiento: 1951", "Inicio de producción: 1957", "Reservas: 37.000 millones de barriles", "Producción diaria: 1,5 millones de barriles", "Superficie: 50 km²", "Tipo de petróleo: crudo pesado"],
