      en: ["The port commenced operations in 1982 to provide logistics support to Riyadh.", "The entire facility covers an area of 918,000 square meters.", "It is connected to Dammam via a 560 km long railway line.", "The annual capacity allows for the handling of over 300,000 TEUs.", "In 2022, a 10-year operating contract was awarded to a subsidiary of MSC.", "There are six large warehouses with a total floor area of 64,000 square meters."],
